alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":20125,"output":1165,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_NP22lPl3ZQpy6QuSvA5b9SFk","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aversion-owner-no-root-view::entry%3Adownload","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"deny"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry boundary, the download action delegates to file_response. That path resolves the requested object and its root, then applies has_perms_owner_aware to the root document before selecting or serving a file. The supplied owner-aware check allows access only when the object has no owner, the object is owned by the caller, or the object-level permission check succeeds. Under the stated premises, the checked object is the root document: it is owned by another user and the caller has no object view_document grant, so the check fails and file_response returns HttpResponseForbidden. Consequently, the requested version is not served. If the check were passed, the file object would be selected separately by _get_effective_file_doc: for an explicitly requested version, that is the resolved requested version document, and serve_file would serve that file object's archive or source file according to the archive/original request. Version ownership therefore does not substitute for root authorization. This is a source-visible deny at the declared entry, not a repository-wide completeness claim; source discovery is not-tested. The supplied source has unresolved helper internals for root resolution, but the declared path and the source-visible root check identify the root as the authorization object, while the task premises supply the root/version relationship and ownership facts.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"DocumentViewSet.download receives the request and calls file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1834,"endLine":1839}]},{"id":"f-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"file_response resolves the requested document and root document before continuing; the resolution result contains request_doc and root_doc.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1401,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The decisive authorization check is has_perms_owner_aware on root_doc for view_document; failure returns HttpResponseForbidden before file selection and serving.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1417,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-control-semantics","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware check permits an unowned object, an object owned by the caller, or an object for which the object-level permission checker grants the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-1f369f7ea734caf5","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization object is root_doc, not the caller-owned requested version; the selected file document is computed only after that root check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1435,"endLine":1441}]},{"id":"f-effect-selection","kind":"effect","statement":"After authorization, _get_effective_file_doc selects the requested version when a version is requested, and file_response passes that file document to serve_file.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1388,"endLine":1399},{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1435,"endLine":1448}]},{"id":"f-effect-serving","kind":"effect","statement":"serve_file serves the selected file document's archive file or source file and returns a FileResponse.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":4941,"endLine":4973}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The supplied scenario premises state that the caller lacks root object view access while the root is owned by another user; under the owner-aware check, neither caller ownership nor an object-level grant supplies the required authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-1f369f7ea734caf5","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":20125,"output":1165,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":62712.168399999995,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T09:42:06.128Z"}}
